WEBVTT

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.870
<i>I want to help you.</i>
<i>I want to hear you say, "I love you."</i>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.180
Where am I?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.520
What is this place?

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.940
Where is everyone?

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.330
Are you lost?

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.090
Miyo...

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.840
Could you tell your father
you want to live with me?

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.590
We can be together every day.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.430
He's going to marry her, right?

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:28.520
Maybe. She's already living with us.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.150
-Oh, man.
-Not a single fish.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.360
-You're all so selfish.
-Miyo...

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.820
I don't blame you.
You have every reason to be angry!

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:42.080
But there are just some things
you won't understand until you're older--

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.750
Then stop telling me things
I don't understand!

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.670
Miyo! Wait!

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:01.510
I hate this.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.020
I hate this stupid world.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.600
I hope the world ends soon.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:12.400
CAT LANTERN

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.370
Masks?

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:29.330
Welcome. Do you want to try one on?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.820
Yori!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.900
Morning!

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.740
Oh, hey. What is it?

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.660
Grumpy as usual, I see!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.500
-But gorgeous as always!
-What are you talking about?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.130
What's the matter?

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.340
-Sorry! Take care of my bag!
-You really shouldn't--

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.060
-My older sister is awful.
-Oh, yeah. Really?

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.110
I did it!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:46.120
Hinode Sunrise... Attack!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.080
Seriously, knock it off.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.000
It's an expression of love!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.590
Hinode, wait!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.880
-Wait up, Hinode! Hinode!
-I can't wait.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.220
That was unbelievably sexy!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:07.600
Did you hear that?
He said, "I can't wait."

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.810
That sounded so suggestive!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:15.020
Like, "Can I kiss you?"
"Wait!" "I can't wait."

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.520
-And then our eyes met! It was crazy!
-Morning!

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.730
-What?! That's awesome!
-And then what?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.150
That's it, unfortunately...

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.820
I got to hear Hinode's sexy voice.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.070
I can die happy right now.
You get it, right?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.410
-Not one bit.
-Hinode, you should be nicer to Muge.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.540
I agree.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.750
-You should whisper in her ear...
-Ignore them.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.830
...with that sexy voice of yours and--

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.500
That hurt! What's your problem?

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:43.670
Shut up! Zip it! Stuff it!
Shut up, shut up!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.010
Hey, Hinode!
Let me record your voice on my phone!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:53.850
I'll listen to it before I sleep.
My dreams will be amazing!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.650
No wonder everyone calls her "Muge,"
Miss Ultra Gaga and Enigmatic.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.190
"I can't wait." He actually said that!

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.740
This is just sad.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.160
What is?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.580
He clearly isn't interested,
but you won't give up. It's depressing.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.250
I see. But still...

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.000
No other girl is as close to him
as I am. That means I'm special, right?

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.420
You're speaking like a true stalker...

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.970
Tell me. Why is it Hinode?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:29.350
He used to give you signals to back off.
Now he just ignores you.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.100
-Yori!
-What?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.720
Are you curious?

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.810
Remember that time it rained
during the festival?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.860
The one I couldn't attend because
of my grandmother's memorial service?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:47.240
<i>That day... We huddled together,</i>
<i>just the two of us.</i>

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:50.490
<i>It was so quiet you couldn't tell</i>
<i>there was a festival going on.</i>

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.700
It's like everything else has disappeared.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.120
You're right.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:06:00.170
The world is filled with things I hate
and things I don't need.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.920
But if there's nothing
when I step out of here...

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.010
I wouldn't want that.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.180
Who knew you were such a romantic!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.730
I wouldn't want that to happen.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.990
That tickles!

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:33.950
You laugh like a little child.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.460
<i>I was sick of this world,</i>
<i>but now I know it isn't so bad.</i>

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.920
Because I met Hinode after all.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:42.960
Muge!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.960
-Your ice cream!
-Get a grip!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:48.720
You're getting your fantasies
confused with reality!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.140
And there goes my ice cream too...

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:54.140
This is just sad. I don't like it!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:59.980
Earth to Muge! Come back to us!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:03.360
It really happened, though.
Why won't you believe--

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.910
I didn't know you hated cats.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.280
It depends on the time, place, and cat.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.830
Later, Yori!

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.920
Don't forget to be
my friend again tomorrow, okay?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.670
Don't be silly. See you.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.000
Bye!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.220
Miyo!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.310
Miyo!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.350
-Hello...
-Are you all right?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.310
Oh, my! Have you lost weight?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.480
-No, not really...
-You're all skin and bones!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.030
I haven't lost any weight...

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:55.120
You don't know how sorry
I feel for you, Miyo.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.910
-You don't have to, really. I'm--
-Is she feeding you?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.250
Yes, of course.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.290
She's living with you, right?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.330
Is she forcing you
to eat food you don't like?

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.880
-Not really...
-Miyo.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.090
-Oh, my! Hello there!
-Hello.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.510
Bye now, Miyo.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.550
-I have to go now.
-Goodbye.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.770
They can't stop nosing around
once they reach her age, huh?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.310
I'm back, Ms. Kaoru.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.110
Welcome back, Miyo.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.570
Kinako!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.950
The weather report says
it'll be sunny tomorrow too.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.080
I'll be airing out
the futon mattresses, so...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.660
-You don't have to worry about mine.
-It'll be fluffier after I air it out.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.870
It's fine! I'll do it myself next time.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.920
-I shouldn't trouble you.
-I don't mind at all.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.300
Kinako!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.800
I'm back, Kinako.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:59.680
I guess you have to raise them
from a young age to make them like you.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.430
There's ice cream in the fridge.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.900
Thanks, but I already had one
on my way home.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:06.810
Really?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:10.230
You should help yourself, Ms. Kaoru.
You and Kinako.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.610
Okay...

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.570
-I'll let you know when dinner is ready.
-Okay!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.870
Kinako, do you want a snack?

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:27.370
I know she's trying to be nice,
but she should just leave me alone.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.670
I have my own plans.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.380
Where is it?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.850
I have my own plans.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.120
Tacky.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:21.800
Yumi.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:26.180
At least help me fold the laundry.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.350
Do I have to?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:29.520
I'm home.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:30.860
Welcome back.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:32.690
Kento?

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.940
Hup!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.870
Explain yourself.
Why didn't you hand this in?

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.330
You're going to Ichi High, right?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.500
I'm still thinking about it.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:52.130
You have to take this seriously.
We're depending on you to support us.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.800
You're expecting the son to
feed the family? That's so old-fashioned.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.300
You haven't contributed anything.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.880
-I'm home, Dad.
-Okay, okay...

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.140
If you're going to your grandpa's,
finish your homework first.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.350
I don't have homework.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.270
-Mom, your panties are huge!
-Be quiet!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.330
Taro?

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.120
Taro?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.290
She isn't here yet?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.170
Taro!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.050
Taro?

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.440
Taro.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.200
You smell like the sun.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.540
<i>Hinode...</i>

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.130
Ken?

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.220
What are you doing?

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.220
She has a lot on her mind.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:29.810
Don't worry about it.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.270
You're a lot smarter than I am.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.770
I can see why Sachiko
has high hopes for you.

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:38.230
But I think you're cool, Grandpa.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.250
The state of your heart
will always show in your work.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.410
Yes, sir...

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.380
Are you hungry?

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.300
I'm going to borrow your kitchen, Grandpa.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.340
Okay, let's take a break.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.220
Today's your lucky day, Taro.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:12.220
You like Ken's cooking, don't you?

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:23.400
She never grooms herself
or sharpens her claws.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.150
What a strange cat.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.320
So scary!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.950
You're Taro's reincarnation, aren't you?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.130
I bet other people are feeding her too.
She'll get fat.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:42.000
I prefer chubby cats.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.300
They shouldn't be obese, of course.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.220
Taro, you're leaving already?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.980
I bet she has plenty of homes
to go back to.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.310
Oh, shoot!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.570
Oh, my gosh! That was amazing!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:58.540
"You're leaving already?"
Oh, my gosh! He's so dreamy!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.420
Oh, shoot!

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.710
Yes... Wait...

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.640
A cat! It's a cat, Mommy! It's so cute!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:20.390
What? Why didn't you tell me
Taro was here?

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:23.190
I bought a treat for her.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.860
Hey, are you still here? Taro?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.610
She left without greeting her owner.
How rude!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.280
She isn't our pet.
And I found her, not you.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.870
That rainy festival day, right?

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:43.250
You skipped out on cram school,
and our dear mother blew her gasket.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:45.960
I'll be going now!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.550
Okay. Thanks for today.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.340
Thank you!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:53.890
Shut up.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.800
I didn't say anything.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:00.980
<i>That day...</i>

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.690
TENNO FESTIVAL

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.320
Fine. Then I'll stop going.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.870
It's just a waste of money, right?

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.000
I don't really care.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:24.500
I don't even want to go to cram school.
I'm hanging up now.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:00.080
<i>That was the day I met Taro.</i>

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:14.170
<i>I wish I didn't have to go</i>
<i>to the bathroom in this body.</i>

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.300
I'll fight you, you brown tabby!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.230
Oh, it's just you.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.900
You should have gone to Hinode's place.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.320
You'd get to spend more time with him.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.360
No way! I have to wipe my butt, okay?

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.610
Cats don't need toilet paper.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.820
We clean ourselves with our tongue.
It's eco-friendly.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.780
That's disgusting!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.580
You have to be more open-minded.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:49.170
You should enjoy living like a cat.
It'll be such a waste if you don't.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.130
I'm having a blast, okay?!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.590
Oh, really?

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:58.890
In that case, you can keep that mask.
Give me your human face in exchange.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.720
-What?
-You don't need it anymore, do you?

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.180
No way!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:08.150
I sell cat masks to humans
who want to be cats.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:13.150
I sell human masks to cats who
want to be humans. That's my job.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:18.070
You have a wonderful cat life
ahead of you now.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.030
Stop following me!

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:24.200
Throw away your tiresome human face.
Enjoy your sweet cat life!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.120
Huh? He disappeared.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:34.000
What's his problem?
"Enjoy your sweet cat life," my butt.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:38.590
I'm rooting for you.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.600
You should tell Hinode
who "Taro" really is.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:51.610
Tell him, "It was me, Muge, all along."

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.650
He'll lose the frosty attitude
and fall head over heels for you.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.490
No way. No, that's never going to happen.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.120
First of all, he'd never believe me.
And even if he did,

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:07.120
what if it backfires
and he ends up hating Taro instead?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.170
I should gather more information as Taro,

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.880
and then use what I know
to get closer to him as Muge.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.590
If that's your plan,
it doesn't seem to be working.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.670
Shut up! Shut it! Shut up! Buzz off!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.260
You know what? You're so shady!

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:24.430
You don't charge anything
for swapping cat and human masks.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.430
What's in it for you?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.480
I'm just doing my best
to reduce, reuse, and recycle!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.640
Liar!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:31.940
What?

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.190
Wait, what?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.410
Boiled potatoes! Boiled potatoes!

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:47.200
Oh, Miyo.
You really like these, don't you?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.920
Now, open wide!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.090
-Hey!
-Open wide!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:06.300
-It's so good! I love it!
-Really?

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.640
Miyo, have some boiled potatoes.
You like them, right?

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:13.810
Is it too bland?

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:15.520
Not at all. It's delicious.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.730
It's healthier this way.
It tastes like haute cuisine.

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.490
Really?

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.900
Right, Miyo?

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.740
I've never had haute cuisine.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.580
Kids like me prefer fatty meat
and strong flavors.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.080
You'll get fat.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:32.210
Hinode said he likes it better
when I'm chubby.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.580
Hinode? Who's that? Is he your boyfriend?

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.790
None of your business.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.250
He is, isn't he? What's he like?

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.970
Did you know about this, Kaoru?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.220
No...

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:46.720
You should bring him home
and introduce him to Kaoru!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.640
What?

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:51.100
You're both women. She'll be
more comfortable discussing this with you.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.930
You can talk to Kaoru about anything.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:56.610
Is he in the same grade?
Or is he your senior?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.320
Who confessed to whom?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.650
He isn't my boyfriend, okay?

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:02.990
Don't be shy. Right?

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:08.070
<i>Just leave me alone already.</i>
<i>I know I don't belong here.</i>

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.750
That's right!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:16.370
I'm going to marry Hinode...

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.790
and move out of here as soon as I can!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.420
In order to do so...

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.880
I can't let this chance slip away.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.470
I love him,
and not just because he took me in.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:32.060
<i>He named me, a female cat, "Taro."</i>

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:37.900
<i>That was the name of his previous dog.</i>
<i>He's so loyal.</i>

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:42.860
<i>He's smart,</i>
<i>but he doesn't take it for granted.</i>

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.360
Taro!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.200
<i>I know what he's really like.</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.240
<i>He ignores me when I'm Muge,</i>
<i>and that makes me sad.</i>

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:56.710
<i>But when I'm Taro, he's so sweet to me.</i>

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.840
I love you, Taro.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.300
You always smell like the sun.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:09.890
<i>Hinode!</i>

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.640
<i>I... I'm actually...</i>

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:15.350
What is it?

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:18.980
<i>I can't do it.</i>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:22.650
<i>I don't have the courage</i>
<i>to tell him I'm Muge.</i>

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:30.410
You're so lucky, Taro.

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:34.200
<i>What's wrong, Hinode?</i>

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:37.120
<i>How can I help you?</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:39.750
I have to make my lunch for tomorrow.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>He's making his own lunch box?</i>

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:45.010
<i>I want to eat it...</i>

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.010
Hinode! Sunrise Attack!

00:22:56.850 --> 00:22:58.600
Come on, Muge...

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:02.560
It's time for lunch.

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:04.480
Here, 50 yen.

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:10.860
My father made my lunch box today.

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:13.160
So you're having rice ball bombs
for lunch today, right?

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:14.450
Yup.

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:15.740
Lucky you!

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:20.210
Are you kidding? I'll have to
dislodge my jaw to eat them.

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:22.580
And the seaweed is always soggy.

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:26.800
Miss Ultra Gaga and Enigmatic.
Pesky, barbaric she-gorilla.

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.170
Why's she so obsessed with Hinode lately?

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:30.130
Who knows?

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.760
It's getting on my nerves.

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:36.060
I feel sorry for Hinode.
This is "the Muge" we're talking about.

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:37.850
-I know, right?
-What's their problem?

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.730
Let them talk, I don't care.

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:43.900
Speaking of Hinode,
he's been acting smug lately.

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:44.860
You think so?

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:46.730
All high and mighty.

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:47.940
What?

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:51.200
His grades shot up. It makes no sense!

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:53.660
He must have cheated on the tests.

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:55.410
His grades were like mine back in--

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:58.160
Muge? What are you planning to do?

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.000
-Food food!
-Thanks for the food.

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:01.670
No, don't!

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:06.920
Muge, calm down! Muge!
Someone stop her, please!

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:10.510
What was that about Hinode? Take it back!

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:12.260
-What? Are you crazy?
-What is she...

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:13.930
Muge?

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:16.720
What?

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:20.890
Muge!

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:28.230
What's with you?

00:24:28.980 --> 00:24:31.700
This is so much easier when I'm a cat.

00:24:32.610 --> 00:24:35.820
-Blood! I'm bleeding!
-Are you crazy?

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:38.410
That's my line!

00:24:38.490 --> 00:24:39.490
What?

00:24:39.580 --> 00:24:40.620
Hinode is always--

00:24:41.580 --> 00:24:43.460
He works really hard!

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:46.840
-Stop lying about him, or I'll--
-Muge!

00:24:49.250 --> 00:24:50.380
Are you okay?

00:24:52.130 --> 00:24:53.550
"Are you okay?"

00:24:55.840 --> 00:24:57.640
-Hey, let's go.
-Yeah.

00:24:57.720 --> 00:25:00.520
I'm fine. I'm totally fine!

00:25:01.180 --> 00:25:02.730
Were you worried about me?

00:25:03.230 --> 00:25:04.890
You should go to the nurse's office.

00:25:04.980 --> 00:25:08.110
-It's nothing, really--
-Let's go.

00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:10.320
Okay.

00:25:14.240 --> 00:25:16.610
You don't have to do that,
I'll clean that up myself.

00:25:16.700 --> 00:25:18.580
You can have half of my lunch box.

00:25:18.660 --> 00:25:22.700
What? What? Wait, really?

00:25:27.420 --> 00:25:30.840
This is... boiled sweet potatoes!

00:25:31.840 --> 00:25:33.920
I didn't know you could cook.

00:25:34.220 --> 00:25:36.380
-You made all that yourself?
-Yup.

00:25:36.470 --> 00:25:37.890
That's incredible!

00:25:37.970 --> 00:25:39.720
My dad should learn
a thing or two from you.

00:25:39.800 --> 00:25:44.680
Look at that color, that shine!
I bet it's really salty.

00:25:44.770 --> 00:25:45.730
Don't complain.

00:25:46.640 --> 00:25:50.690
That was a compliment!
It tastes just like my mom's.

00:25:51.650 --> 00:25:53.860
You should have ignored those two.

00:25:53.990 --> 00:25:55.200
I agree.

00:25:55.490 --> 00:25:57.990
They can say whatever they want about me.

00:25:58.410 --> 00:26:01.530
But I won't let them
slander you like that.

00:26:03.120 --> 00:26:05.910
These boiled potatoes are amazing!

00:26:09.830 --> 00:26:11.710
-Hey!
-Muge, what are you doing?

00:26:14.630 --> 00:26:16.840
Hinode's boiled potatoes are...

00:26:17.180 --> 00:26:19.930
really salty!

00:26:22.180 --> 00:26:24.310
You should say it's delicious.

00:26:24.390 --> 00:26:25.980
"Really salty"?

00:26:26.060 --> 00:26:28.190
I see. Okay! Then...

00:26:28.270 --> 00:26:30.310
-Hinode's boiled potatoes are--
-Knock it off!

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:32.440
You don't have to redo it!

00:26:32.520 --> 00:26:33.690
Why?

00:26:39.860 --> 00:26:42.410
His rice may be salty too, Muge.

00:26:42.490 --> 00:26:43.870
Shut up!

00:26:44.740 --> 00:26:47.460
<i>Did I just make Hinode laugh?</i>

00:26:48.290 --> 00:26:50.460
Don't go jumping off
buildings again, okay?

00:26:50.920 --> 00:26:52.170
You're not a cat.

00:26:55.460 --> 00:26:56.760
Ta-da!

00:26:57.800 --> 00:26:59.300
<i>She has the same scent.</i>

00:26:59.630 --> 00:27:02.890
Eat up, Hinode. Don't be shy. Open wide.

00:27:02.970 --> 00:27:04.180
It's my lunch box, okay?

00:27:06.850 --> 00:27:08.640
Miyo is my daughter, not yours.

00:27:08.730 --> 00:27:11.020
How can you be so cruel?
Stop hurting her.

00:27:18.320 --> 00:27:21.820
Hinode Sunrise Jump!

00:27:27.540 --> 00:27:28.710
The door is unlocked.

00:27:29.500 --> 00:27:31.080
There we go.

00:27:33.920 --> 00:27:35.040
Welcome home.

00:27:35.420 --> 00:27:36.380
Thanks.

00:27:37.210 --> 00:27:39.670
What happened to your leg? Are you hurt?

00:27:39.760 --> 00:27:43.180
Oh, this? It's just a scratch.

00:27:43.890 --> 00:27:45.930
-But...
-No, really!

00:27:46.010 --> 00:27:48.350
-I'll leave my lunch box in the sink!
-Okay.

00:27:49.430 --> 00:27:52.600
Onions? That means we're having...

00:27:52.690 --> 00:27:54.480
Curry? Or maybe meat and potatoes?

00:27:55.230 --> 00:27:57.980
Did something happen?
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:27:58.110 --> 00:28:01.070
Oh, no. Not at all!

00:28:09.830 --> 00:28:11.040
"Are you okay?"

00:28:16.670 --> 00:28:18.170
Hinode.

00:28:28.850 --> 00:28:31.810
Oh, man. I want to see him laugh again.

00:28:37.820 --> 00:28:39.480
Purr-fect landing.

00:29:16.020 --> 00:29:17.860
It looks like he isn't home yet.

00:29:18.400 --> 00:29:19.730
You can't be serious!

00:29:20.730 --> 00:29:25.740
We can't afford to keep the studio.
It's too expensive.

00:29:26.200 --> 00:29:29.660
At this rate, we won't be able to pay
Mr. Sakaguchi his salary.

00:29:29.910 --> 00:29:31.950
But Grandpa can still--

00:29:32.040 --> 00:29:35.960
Don't be selfish.
His eyesight is getting worse anyway.

00:29:37.580 --> 00:29:40.170
I wanted to continue, but she's right.

00:29:40.250 --> 00:29:41.420
Are you sure about this?

00:29:42.760 --> 00:29:44.590
I'm sorry, Kento.

00:29:45.170 --> 00:29:47.430
You should focus on your entrance exams.

00:29:47.970 --> 00:29:50.930
If you want to use the kiln,
you should do it soon.

00:29:54.100 --> 00:29:56.190
Hey. Are we really shutting down
the studio?

00:29:56.270 --> 00:29:57.100
Yes.

00:29:57.190 --> 00:29:59.690
-What about Mr. Sakaguchi?
-He'll be quitting.

00:29:59.770 --> 00:30:00.940
Are you serious?

00:30:01.440 --> 00:30:03.530
Listen, I have an idea!

00:30:03.610 --> 00:30:06.990
We should ask Mr. Sakaguchi
to start a pottery class.

00:30:07.070 --> 00:30:09.780
There are already too many
pottery classes in this town.

00:30:09.870 --> 00:30:10.870
That won't help.

00:30:10.950 --> 00:30:11.990
What?

00:30:12.080 --> 00:30:15.660
All the girls in town will be interested
if Mr. Sakaguchi's the instructor.

00:30:15.750 --> 00:30:17.960
-Well, I'll join the class too.
-Overruled.

00:30:18.040 --> 00:30:19.830
Oh, come on!

00:30:38.390 --> 00:30:39.770
<i>Hinode...</i>

00:30:45.570 --> 00:30:47.320
The sweet and sour pork is delicious.

00:30:47.950 --> 00:30:48.780
Really?

00:30:49.320 --> 00:30:53.200
Right? The onions make or break this dish.

00:30:57.210 --> 00:30:58.750
Why is it so good?

00:30:58.830 --> 00:31:00.710
It has a strong flavor,
the way you like it.

00:31:01.040 --> 00:31:02.880
I'm glad you like it.

00:31:11.510 --> 00:31:14.510
Hinode looked so sad.

00:31:15.140 --> 00:31:20.020
But I can't help him.
Not as Muge or as Taro.

00:31:20.560 --> 00:31:23.440
And the sweet and sour pork was good.
I hate this!

00:31:49.130 --> 00:31:50.130
Taro!

00:32:03.810 --> 00:32:06.230
Huh? Did you injure your leg?

00:32:08.650 --> 00:32:09.780
So you did.

00:32:11.490 --> 00:32:12.700
Are you okay?

00:32:15.200 --> 00:32:16.580
It's just like her injury.

00:32:23.620 --> 00:32:27.590
I wish I could speak my mind like her.

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:34.220
I want to continue doing pottery.
I know the studio isn't doing so well.

00:32:34.760 --> 00:32:37.310
I want to tell them,
"I'll be in charge of the studio."

00:32:37.810 --> 00:32:41.730
But I'm not that confident myself...
So I didn't say anything.

00:32:43.560 --> 00:32:45.350
I don't know how Grandpa does it.

00:32:45.730 --> 00:32:49.690
In his hands, ordinary clay turns
into all kinds of shapes and colors.

00:32:50.690 --> 00:32:52.610
I've always wanted to be like him.

00:32:53.240 --> 00:32:54.820
But I couldn't say it...

00:33:00.160 --> 00:33:04.710
If Muge were in my shoes,
I know she would have said it.

00:33:05.420 --> 00:33:08.460
<i>Hinode. I'm just like you.</i>

00:33:09.340 --> 00:33:11.550
<i>I can't say the things I really want to.</i>

00:33:14.380 --> 00:33:16.180
You're amazing, Hinode!

00:33:16.970 --> 00:33:21.640
I used to wish the world would end,
every single day.

00:33:22.100 --> 00:33:25.060
But now... after meeting you...

00:33:25.690 --> 00:33:30.400
after falling in love with you,
the world seems so beautiful to me!

00:33:31.190 --> 00:33:34.900
<i>I... I want to help you.</i>

00:33:36.280 --> 00:33:38.070
I want to hear you say, "I love you."

00:33:49.500 --> 00:33:51.880
I have to study more pottery.

00:33:51.960 --> 00:33:54.760
There's nothing special
about my creations right now.

00:33:56.130 --> 00:33:58.390
I have to go to Tonomori High School.

00:34:02.810 --> 00:34:05.600
I have to tell Mom about my plans.

00:34:08.150 --> 00:34:09.110
Let's go, Taro.

00:34:35.050 --> 00:34:37.590
Did you tell him the truth?

00:34:37.880 --> 00:34:38.840
Of course not!

00:34:38.930 --> 00:34:43.220
I see. So, at this rate,
if you're never going to tell him,

00:34:43.310 --> 00:34:44.890
why don't you...

00:34:45.680 --> 00:34:47.520
stay a cat forever?

00:34:48.140 --> 00:34:52.730
No way! I can't do anything
for Hinode if I'm a cat.

00:34:54.860 --> 00:34:57.570
You can't help him as a human either.

00:34:58.360 --> 00:35:00.740
-That's not...
-It's not true?

00:35:02.740 --> 00:35:05.450
Are you sure about that?

00:35:05.910 --> 00:35:09.830
As a cat, you'll be able
to stay close to Hinode!

00:35:09.920 --> 00:35:13.960
You'll be able to observe him,
sleep, have him feed you, sleep,

00:35:14.050 --> 00:35:15.670
poop, sleep...

00:35:15.760 --> 00:35:18.130
Isn't that wonderful?

00:35:18.220 --> 00:35:20.220
Hinode will be happy too!

00:35:20.300 --> 00:35:22.260
Shut up! Shut up! Shut it!

00:35:31.850 --> 00:35:35.570
<i>The world is filled with things I hate</i>
<i>and things I don't need.</i>

00:35:37.030 --> 00:35:40.450
<i>But if there's nothing</i>
<i>when I step out of here,</i>

00:35:41.910 --> 00:35:43.660
I wouldn't want that.

00:35:46.700 --> 00:35:48.910
I wouldn't want that to happen.

00:35:52.330 --> 00:35:53.920
That tickles!

00:36:00.220 --> 00:36:01.050
All right.

00:36:14.900 --> 00:36:18.940
Something doesn't feel right.
Was Ms. Kaoru in my room?

00:36:23.860 --> 00:36:26.330
Her shoes are still here.
She must have gone out the window.

00:36:26.410 --> 00:36:28.080
At this hour? Without her shoes?

00:36:28.160 --> 00:36:31.120
-Oh, shoot.
-She's been sneaking out lately.

00:36:34.420 --> 00:36:37.380
What do we do? It doesn't feel right
for me to scold her.

00:36:37.550 --> 00:36:39.760
I know how you feel.

00:36:42.630 --> 00:36:44.050
Wait! What?

00:36:45.090 --> 00:36:45.930
Miyo?

00:36:49.680 --> 00:36:50.730
What is it?

00:36:50.810 --> 00:36:53.060
Miyo, did you go somewhere?

00:36:55.230 --> 00:36:59.070
I wanted to have tea together,
but you weren't in your room.

00:37:00.110 --> 00:37:04.610
-Well... I was up on the roof.
-What?

00:37:05.030 --> 00:37:08.660
Sometimes you just want to feel
the wind on your face, you know?

00:37:09.200 --> 00:37:11.000
Well, good night!

00:37:11.500 --> 00:37:12.460
-Night...
-Good night.

00:37:17.380 --> 00:37:19.460
Hinode Sunrise is...

00:37:19.550 --> 00:37:21.920
<i>I don't want empty words</i>
<i>to protect myself.</i>

00:37:22.420 --> 00:37:25.890
<i>I'd rather have Hinode's</i>
<i>scathing honesty instead.</i>

00:37:27.010 --> 00:37:28.350
No, that doesn't sound right.

00:37:34.730 --> 00:37:36.350
<i>Who needs Miyo Sasaki?</i>

00:37:37.020 --> 00:37:41.480
<i>Miyo Hinode...</i>
<i>Let's watch the sunrise together.</i>

00:37:53.500 --> 00:37:55.830
Did you stay up late to study?
That's so unlike you.

00:37:55.920 --> 00:37:57.750
I was thinking about my life.

00:37:58.540 --> 00:37:59.630
-Morning!
-Hey.

00:38:00.420 --> 00:38:01.250
-Morning.
-Hey.

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:05.380
-Morning.
-Morning!

00:38:05.470 --> 00:38:07.180
-Morning.
-Morning!

00:38:09.800 --> 00:38:11.100
What is it?

00:38:17.350 --> 00:38:19.060
What's going on?

00:38:19.440 --> 00:38:21.480
-Hinode?
-What is it?

00:38:22.650 --> 00:38:24.780
This is for you!

00:38:24.860 --> 00:38:25.820
-What?
-What?

00:38:26.740 --> 00:38:27.610
TO KENTO HINODE

00:38:28.660 --> 00:38:32.490
Is that a letter I see, Miss Muge?

00:38:32.830 --> 00:38:34.250
It's none of your business!

00:38:37.330 --> 00:38:38.790
Is it a love letter?

00:38:38.870 --> 00:38:40.330
-Give it back!
-Niibori!

00:38:40.420 --> 00:38:41.250
-Got it!
-Muge!

00:38:41.750 --> 00:38:44.760
Miss Muge, Miss Muge! Over here!

00:38:46.260 --> 00:38:48.430
-Confession time!
-Knock it off!

00:38:48.930 --> 00:38:51.100
How about I read it out loud?

00:38:52.050 --> 00:38:54.470
Ta-da!

00:38:55.310 --> 00:38:58.850
-Cut it out, you two!
-Are you really going to read it, Bannai?

00:38:59.900 --> 00:39:02.190
She went all out! How pathetic can you be?

00:39:03.020 --> 00:39:08.030
"To Hinode.
I feel happy whenever I see you."

00:39:08.110 --> 00:39:12.700
-Bannai!
-"Hinode Sunrise isn't just a pun."

00:39:12.780 --> 00:39:13.990
Give it back!

00:39:14.740 --> 00:39:18.750
"It's how I feel about you.
You're my sunrise."

00:39:18.830 --> 00:39:21.630
-The letter isn't for you!
-Give it back!

00:39:21.710 --> 00:39:23.210
-Give it back!
-"Hinode Sunrise is

00:39:23.290 --> 00:39:25.590
when the sun rises above the horizon

00:39:25.670 --> 00:39:27.970
-and warms my soul."
-Stop it!

00:39:28.050 --> 00:39:29.170
Give it back!

00:39:30.180 --> 00:39:31.720
Why are you so desperate?

00:39:33.260 --> 00:39:35.220
Is this too embarrassing for you?

00:39:35.310 --> 00:39:40.560
Why should I be embarrassed?
Don't make fun of my feelings!

00:39:42.810 --> 00:39:47.030
Are you going to accept
her love confession?

00:39:47.360 --> 00:39:50.240
Mr. Sunrise?

00:39:52.990 --> 00:39:53.870
Hinode...

00:40:00.920 --> 00:40:01.790
What?

00:40:03.750 --> 00:40:04.630
Why?

00:40:06.630 --> 00:40:08.960
Confession time! Confession!

00:40:09.050 --> 00:40:10.010
Shut up!

00:40:10.840 --> 00:40:15.680
I just wanted you to cheer up.

00:40:15.760 --> 00:40:19.600
I'm just like you.
I can't say the things I truly feel.

00:40:19.890 --> 00:40:23.310
-So--
-I'm not like you!

00:40:25.360 --> 00:40:26.820
This is embarrassing for me.

00:40:27.650 --> 00:40:31.150
Have you considered my feelings?
He read it in front of everyone.

00:40:31.740 --> 00:40:34.990
I hate pushy people like you.

00:40:36.370 --> 00:40:38.700
But... what if I told you
in person instead--

00:40:38.790 --> 00:40:42.540
Just leave me alone!
Didn't you hear me? I hate you!

00:40:43.710 --> 00:40:45.710
You hate me?

00:40:47.460 --> 00:40:48.590
I really hate you.

00:40:51.510 --> 00:40:54.220
I see.

00:40:59.260 --> 00:41:01.020
You hate me that much, huh?

00:41:02.140 --> 00:41:03.060
Muge?

00:41:05.020 --> 00:41:07.020
That's too bad.

00:41:09.400 --> 00:41:10.480
Muge!

00:41:11.780 --> 00:41:12.650
Die!

00:41:17.950 --> 00:41:19.870
I told you to give up on him!

00:41:20.700 --> 00:41:23.960
I should be the one crying, you know.

00:41:24.670 --> 00:41:27.420
Give up on Hinode already.

00:41:27.500 --> 00:41:29.420
What? I can't.

00:41:29.500 --> 00:41:32.260
Give up on him,
or we're no longer friends.

00:41:32.760 --> 00:41:34.260
I don't want that either.

00:41:37.760 --> 00:41:40.100
-Yori?
-You're such an idiot!

00:41:45.850 --> 00:41:47.860
Miyo? Are you there?

00:41:48.770 --> 00:41:51.230
-I'm here.
-Would you like to have tea?

00:41:53.530 --> 00:41:54.950
I'll pass.

00:41:56.070 --> 00:41:57.240
Can I come in?

00:41:57.320 --> 00:41:59.160
What? One second!

00:42:02.490 --> 00:42:03.370
Okay, come in.

00:42:08.540 --> 00:42:12.170
I can't have tea,
I'm trying to lose weight.

00:42:13.630 --> 00:42:14.630
Miyo...

00:42:16.430 --> 00:42:18.800
Do I make you uncomfortable?

00:42:19.680 --> 00:42:22.510
What? That sounds like a soap opera!

00:42:22.600 --> 00:42:26.690
No, of course not. That's ridiculous!

00:42:26.770 --> 00:42:30.730
Why are you smiling like that?
You always do that.

00:42:31.440 --> 00:42:34.150
Are you forcing yourself
to be someone you're not?

00:42:34.780 --> 00:42:37.990
-Miyo, I...
-So selfish.

00:42:38.450 --> 00:42:39.820
What? Selfish...

00:42:40.160 --> 00:42:43.410
You're all so selfish! So self-centered!

00:42:44.870 --> 00:42:45.700
Miyo?

00:42:47.540 --> 00:42:50.330
So what if I'm forcing myself to smile?

00:42:51.000 --> 00:42:53.590
I do it because I want to!

00:42:54.130 --> 00:42:56.380
A stepmom? So?

00:42:56.470 --> 00:43:00.090
You and Dad already knew
I wouldn't be happy about this!

00:43:00.590 --> 00:43:04.680
But I'm doing my best
to live peacefully with you, aren't I?

00:43:04.770 --> 00:43:06.020
And now...

00:43:06.390 --> 00:43:08.810
you want me to stop smiling
if I don't mean it?

00:43:08.890 --> 00:43:11.440
-It's all about what you want, isn't it?
-Miyo!

00:43:13.150 --> 00:43:15.030
Don't get me started on Mom.

00:43:15.110 --> 00:43:17.950
She abandoned me and walked out!

00:43:18.950 --> 00:43:21.200
And now she says
she wants to live with me?

00:43:21.620 --> 00:43:25.490
I don't care about Mom, Dad, or you!

00:43:25.830 --> 00:43:27.410
I couldn't care less!

00:43:28.830 --> 00:43:30.500
I don't need any of you!

00:43:34.800 --> 00:43:36.050
-Miyo!
-Miyo!

00:43:37.170 --> 00:43:38.300
Wait!

00:43:38.550 --> 00:43:39.630
Come back!

00:43:44.220 --> 00:43:45.390
Miyo!

00:43:49.310 --> 00:43:50.730
I don't care anymore...

00:43:51.600 --> 00:43:55.690
Ms. Kaoru, Kinako, Dad, Mom...

00:43:56.940 --> 00:44:00.820
I don't care if they all hate me.

00:44:02.110 --> 00:44:04.530
Hinode is all I need.

00:44:19.210 --> 00:44:23.640
I'm such an idiot. Yori was right.

00:44:26.050 --> 00:44:29.180
He didn't mean anything
when he shared his lunch with me.

00:44:29.980 --> 00:44:32.190
But I got ahead of myself
and wrote him a letter.

00:44:33.560 --> 00:44:35.860
And now he says he hates me.

00:44:37.650 --> 00:44:39.150
Why?

00:44:39.650 --> 00:44:42.780
I want to hear him say, "I like you."

00:44:43.610 --> 00:44:45.990
I want to hear him say, "I love you."

00:44:55.000 --> 00:44:56.880
<i>Hinode Sunrise is</i>

00:44:56.960 --> 00:45:00.960
<i>when the sun rises above the horizon</i>
<i>and warms my soul.</i>

00:45:01.670 --> 00:45:04.840
<i>When I'm with you,</i>
<i>I feel warm and fuzzy inside.</i>

00:45:04.930 --> 00:45:06.850
<i>I know other people feel the same way too.</i>

00:45:07.300 --> 00:45:10.430
<i>Even if things don't go your way,</i>
<i>please don't blame yourself...</i>

00:45:10.680 --> 00:45:14.190
I'm just like you.
I can't say what I truly feel.

00:45:15.480 --> 00:45:18.820
Why did she say that?

00:45:19.360 --> 00:45:22.650
I never told her about my troubles.

00:45:26.070 --> 00:45:28.200
Isn't this a little late for you?

00:45:32.040 --> 00:45:34.790
Remember that plate you stepped on?
You left a paw print.

00:45:37.040 --> 00:45:40.380
That was genius. Grandpa was impressed.

00:45:42.510 --> 00:45:45.590
"I'm not like you..."

00:46:04.650 --> 00:46:05.900
The scent of the sun.

00:46:07.660 --> 00:46:08.870
Her scent.

00:46:10.830 --> 00:46:15.580
<i>She didn't seem like the type</i>
<i>to have trouble expressing herself.</i>

00:46:20.540 --> 00:46:22.300
Wait, what?

00:46:30.640 --> 00:46:31.680
I love you!

00:46:38.690 --> 00:46:40.230
Why didn't I see it?

00:46:42.770 --> 00:46:43.940
"I love you."

00:46:57.910 --> 00:47:02.540
<i>So if I was Taro, he'd love me?</i>

00:47:04.300 --> 00:47:06.050
<i>Hinode Sunrise.</i>

00:47:07.760 --> 00:47:12.390
<i>It was always my dream</i>
<i>to see the sunrise with Hinode.</i>

00:47:24.480 --> 00:47:25.820
<i>This is...</i>

00:47:27.190 --> 00:47:29.530
<i>Oh, right. This is Hinode's house.</i>

00:47:29.990 --> 00:47:34.530
<i>What? Oh, shoot! Look at the time!</i>
<i>I'm late for school!</i>

00:47:36.580 --> 00:47:39.160
<i>Oh, yeah. I'm a cat. I don't have to go.</i>

00:47:45.710 --> 00:47:46.630
Mask Seller!

00:47:46.710 --> 00:47:49.050
Everything's better when you're a cat!

00:47:49.130 --> 00:47:51.590
It's all sunshine and rainbows.

00:47:51.680 --> 00:47:55.510
I'm a cat, so you can take my word for it.
There's no doubt about it!

00:47:57.100 --> 00:47:58.020
I'm done.

00:47:58.100 --> 00:47:59.890
What do you mean?

00:48:00.350 --> 00:48:02.850
I'm done with being Miyo.

00:48:03.360 --> 00:48:06.980
Is that right? Good, very good.

00:48:07.650 --> 00:48:08.990
<i>I'm done.</i>

00:48:19.290 --> 00:48:21.460
-Thanks!
-What's that?

00:48:21.750 --> 00:48:23.420
Your human face.

00:48:23.580 --> 00:48:26.800
It comes off when you're sure
you don't want to be human anymore.

00:48:26.880 --> 00:48:28.670
You'll stay as a cat now.

00:48:28.880 --> 00:48:31.090
What? I can't go back to being human?

00:48:31.590 --> 00:48:34.050
You can.
If you put this mask back on, that is!

00:48:34.550 --> 00:48:37.720
But you have to do it
before you turn into a real cat.

00:48:38.060 --> 00:48:42.690
It'll take a little more time
to complete your transformation.

00:48:42.770 --> 00:48:46.310
When the time comes,
I'll take you to a wonderful place

00:48:46.400 --> 00:48:48.190
to commemorate the occasion.

00:48:49.360 --> 00:48:51.110
Wait, I'm not--

00:49:01.200 --> 00:49:03.170
Goodbye, Muge.

00:49:05.790 --> 00:49:07.540
Fukase, Hinode, come with me.

00:49:07.630 --> 00:49:09.550
PRINCIPAL'S RECEPTION ROOM

00:49:09.750 --> 00:49:10.840
She ran away from home?

00:49:11.380 --> 00:49:12.760
Do you know anything about it?

00:49:13.010 --> 00:49:14.010
No...

00:49:14.090 --> 00:49:16.600
-Are you Hinode?
-Yes.

00:49:17.430 --> 00:49:19.850
-Are you going out with Miyo?
-What?

00:49:20.180 --> 00:49:23.140
Miyo mentioned you once.

00:49:23.230 --> 00:49:25.650
Did she go to your place?

00:49:25.730 --> 00:49:28.400
-No...
-Please tell us the truth.

00:49:28.820 --> 00:49:29.860
We won't get angry.

00:49:30.360 --> 00:49:32.240
They're not a couple.

00:49:32.320 --> 00:49:36.240
But Miyo has been sneaking out
of her room every day...

00:49:36.320 --> 00:49:37.740
They're not a couple!

00:49:38.200 --> 00:49:40.490
I should know.
I walk home with Muge every day.

00:49:40.830 --> 00:49:44.920
If you know where she is, please tell us.

00:49:45.000 --> 00:49:47.420
If I knew, I...

00:49:48.380 --> 00:49:50.840
wouldn't be such a useless friend!

00:49:54.420 --> 00:49:55.680
If you'll excuse us...

00:49:55.760 --> 00:49:56.640
Thanks.

00:50:01.970 --> 00:50:04.350
What did they want? Is it about Muge?

00:50:04.600 --> 00:50:07.230
Yeah... She ran away from home.

00:50:07.310 --> 00:50:08.310
Really?

00:50:08.770 --> 00:50:11.530
Bannai and Niibori must have gotten
under her skin this time.

00:50:11.610 --> 00:50:12.690
I'm not so sure about that.

00:50:12.980 --> 00:50:16.150
She would never run away from home
because of losers like them.

00:50:16.610 --> 00:50:17.490
You think so?

00:50:18.570 --> 00:50:21.120
You've been her friend
since grade school, right?

00:50:21.740 --> 00:50:26.500
She's Miss Ultra Gaga and Enigmatic to us,
but not to you. You understand her.

00:50:27.960 --> 00:50:30.420
I'm going to look for Muge!

00:50:30.500 --> 00:50:31.920
-What, now?
-What?

00:50:32.000 --> 00:50:34.630
-Isami, tell the teachers--
-No!

00:50:34.710 --> 00:50:37.220
-Don't! I'll look for her alone!
-What are you--

00:50:37.800 --> 00:50:39.430
-You can't look for her!
-What?

00:50:40.300 --> 00:50:42.060
-Hey, what's going on?
-Wait! No!

00:50:42.140 --> 00:50:44.310
-Isami?
-I came to check on them!

00:50:44.390 --> 00:50:45.850
Okay, let's go back to class!

00:50:47.890 --> 00:50:51.020
<i>I see. I didn't know</i>
<i>about her family situation.</i>

00:50:51.770 --> 00:50:55.990
<i>Her mother walked out on her</i>
<i>when she was in grade school.</i>

00:50:56.070 --> 00:51:00.030
She was ostracized by
our classmates because of that.

00:51:00.280 --> 00:51:02.870
I was her close friend until then.

00:51:03.580 --> 00:51:06.120
But she didn't want them
to bully me, so...

00:51:06.410 --> 00:51:08.960
Yeah... I guess that happens.

00:51:09.460 --> 00:51:10.630
You guess?

00:51:11.840 --> 00:51:13.590
Yori!

00:51:14.590 --> 00:51:18.090
Yoriko's walking home with us. Right?

00:51:19.760 --> 00:51:22.890
She says she doesn't need you,
Miss Ultra Gaga and Enigmatic.

00:51:22.970 --> 00:51:26.770
-I bet your mom told you the same thing.
-Let's go, Yoriko.

00:51:27.640 --> 00:51:28.600
Okay...

00:51:44.780 --> 00:51:45.830
That hurt!

00:51:45.910 --> 00:51:47.790
Are you crazy? Why would you do that?

00:51:47.870 --> 00:51:49.410
I'll tell the teachers about this!

00:51:49.500 --> 00:51:50.710
This is bullying!

00:51:51.000 --> 00:51:54.840
I don't need you either!
I don't need Yori or my mom!

00:51:55.630 --> 00:51:58.880
I don't need you!
I don't need anyone! No one!

00:52:08.520 --> 00:52:10.140
Wait up!

00:52:12.650 --> 00:52:13.690
Muge, wait up!

00:52:14.310 --> 00:52:16.020
I need you, Muge!

00:52:16.690 --> 00:52:19.900
Maybe you don't need me, but I need you!

00:52:27.410 --> 00:52:28.580
Muge!

00:52:38.420 --> 00:52:40.170
Muge, I'm sorry!

00:52:43.680 --> 00:52:45.350
Muge, wait!

00:52:49.220 --> 00:52:52.690
I'm sorry! Muge!

00:52:53.100 --> 00:52:54.770
<i>That's when I realized that...</i>

00:52:55.610 --> 00:52:59.940
Muge always puts on a brave face.
She pretends she's all right...

00:53:00.820 --> 00:53:02.990
even when she's hurting inside.

00:53:04.990 --> 00:53:07.740
Hey, Hinode, did you mean it
when you told Muge you hate her?

00:53:07.830 --> 00:53:08.870
What?

00:53:09.160 --> 00:53:12.710
If you meant what you said,
I want you to ignore Muge.

00:53:13.420 --> 00:53:14.330
What?

00:53:14.420 --> 00:53:17.000
Don't get her hopes up.

00:53:18.090 --> 00:53:19.130
I...

00:53:19.210 --> 00:53:22.130
What? Wait! Don't say anything!

00:53:23.340 --> 00:53:27.430
I need to be sure.
Do you actually like Muge?

00:53:27.510 --> 00:53:31.100
If you do, she has to be the first
to hear it from you, not me.

00:53:33.810 --> 00:53:37.480
Well, I don't actually hate her.

00:53:40.280 --> 00:53:42.940
TOKONAME PUBLIC JUNIOR HIGH

00:53:52.410 --> 00:53:56.620
Her friend called Miyo "Muge."

00:53:57.040 --> 00:53:59.460
Yeah. It's her nickname.

00:53:59.540 --> 00:54:03.340
I had no idea. Does her mother know?

00:54:09.680 --> 00:54:11.770
-Oh, man...
-What's the matter?

00:54:12.470 --> 00:54:14.390
<i>She's coming over.</i>

00:54:16.730 --> 00:54:18.520
Wait, that's Mom's bike.

00:54:25.400 --> 00:54:28.740
I told you to get her a smartphone!

00:54:30.660 --> 00:54:33.700
Why did you go to her school?

00:54:33.790 --> 00:54:37.460
Have you thought about what
her classmates might say about you two?

00:54:37.870 --> 00:54:40.790
We figured her friends
might know something.

00:54:40.880 --> 00:54:46.880
You could have called her friends, then!
Don't you know who her friends are?

00:54:47.430 --> 00:54:48.300
I don't.

00:54:48.380 --> 00:54:49.760
You call yourself her father?

00:54:50.390 --> 00:54:53.140
She didn't go to your place, Ms. Miki?

00:54:53.520 --> 00:54:54.560
What are you implying?

00:54:55.140 --> 00:54:56.600
Miyo is--

00:54:56.680 --> 00:54:58.440
She can't be herself around you!

00:54:58.520 --> 00:55:02.110
She's too kind to be honest with you.
But what would you know about that?

00:55:02.190 --> 00:55:05.570
You forced yourself into her life
and into this family.

00:55:05.650 --> 00:55:06.990
You obviously wouldn't understand!

00:55:07.650 --> 00:55:11.620
That's my line. Did you
stop to think about her feelings

00:55:11.950 --> 00:55:12.870
when you abandoned her?

00:55:13.620 --> 00:55:14.450
Excuse me?

00:55:15.200 --> 00:55:17.540
Don't you know how much pain
you've caused her--

00:55:20.580 --> 00:55:22.710
-Hey, hey!
-What was that for?

00:55:22.790 --> 00:55:26.340
I want to be her mother again!
But you're just in the way!

00:55:26.420 --> 00:55:28.380
Hey, knock it off!

00:55:31.510 --> 00:55:34.180
-I just want Miyo to be--
-What the hell!

00:55:36.980 --> 00:55:39.770
<i>This isn't the best time to say goodbye...</i>

00:55:42.730 --> 00:55:43.770
Muge...

00:55:45.070 --> 00:55:46.230
Where are you?

00:56:01.000 --> 00:56:02.040
<i>Yori?</i>

00:56:04.340 --> 00:56:06.210
I looked all over for you, Fukase.

00:56:06.300 --> 00:56:07.760
I'm sorry.

00:56:07.840 --> 00:56:09.800
Did you find Sasaki?

00:56:09.920 --> 00:56:10.760
No...

00:56:10.840 --> 00:56:13.800
I see. We'll let her parents handle it.

00:56:13.890 --> 00:56:16.010
-Let's go back to school.
-Yes, sir.

00:56:16.560 --> 00:56:17.470
Where's Hinode?

00:56:17.850 --> 00:56:20.060
He went to the train station
to look for Miyo.

00:56:20.140 --> 00:56:23.150
<i>Wait, Hinode is looking for me?</i>

00:56:26.360 --> 00:56:27.530
<i>Really?</i>

00:56:28.940 --> 00:56:31.820
That's all we know.
I know you're worried about her,

00:56:31.910 --> 00:56:34.200
but please leave this to the adults.

00:56:40.620 --> 00:56:42.750
Kento should be back soon.

00:56:45.920 --> 00:56:49.260
You must really...

00:56:51.550 --> 00:56:53.840
<i>I didn't catch that, Grandpa.</i>

00:56:55.220 --> 00:56:57.180
<i>Could you repeat that?</i>

00:56:57.470 --> 00:57:00.730
Sorry, I don't know what to feed you.

00:57:01.680 --> 00:57:02.640
I'm home, Grandpa!

00:57:04.230 --> 00:57:05.230
Welcome back.

00:57:05.310 --> 00:57:07.730
Mom isn't back yet, right?

00:57:08.780 --> 00:57:09.690
Taro?

00:57:11.780 --> 00:57:13.660
I have to go out again.

00:57:13.740 --> 00:57:15.370
Could you make up an excuse to Mom for me?

00:57:15.450 --> 00:57:16.660
Sure.

00:57:22.080 --> 00:57:24.670
Maybe you'll be able to find her, Taro.

00:57:46.850 --> 00:57:48.110
Next, please.

00:57:49.320 --> 00:57:51.190
Where did she go?

00:57:52.150 --> 00:57:56.610
<i>Wait... Is everyone looking for me?</i>

00:58:09.710 --> 00:58:12.880
I didn't know anything about her.

00:58:14.050 --> 00:58:18.510
Where does she usually spend her time?
What does she like? What's on her mind?

00:58:20.390 --> 00:58:22.720
I had no idea what she was going through.

00:58:24.180 --> 00:58:29.310
She was always smiling and laughing
around me. She did it for me.

00:58:32.230 --> 00:58:36.700
Compared to me,
she's so strong and amazing.

00:58:38.110 --> 00:58:39.870
It's an expression of love!

00:58:41.030 --> 00:58:41.990
I see.

00:58:42.620 --> 00:58:47.580
I was afraid she would see me
for who I am, a nobody.

00:58:48.580 --> 00:58:49.460
<i>Hinode...</i>

00:58:51.090 --> 00:58:56.170
I have to apologize to her.
She'll come back, right?

00:58:56.880 --> 00:59:00.140
You're amazing, Hinode. I know you are.

00:59:01.050 --> 00:59:04.390
You care about your family.
You're loyal to your friends.

00:59:04.770 --> 00:59:06.560
You're gentle with animals.

00:59:07.770 --> 00:59:10.690
That's why... I love you!

00:59:11.770 --> 00:59:12.690
Muge...

00:59:13.110 --> 00:59:14.070
<i>Yes?</i>

00:59:14.400 --> 00:59:18.030
I should have been...

00:59:19.200 --> 00:59:20.320
<i>What?</i>

00:59:22.330 --> 00:59:25.870
Her letter... if only I had...

00:59:26.830 --> 00:59:29.710
<i>I don't understand what he's saying.</i>

00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:33.500
<i>So, I really am turning into a cat.</i>

00:59:36.420 --> 00:59:37.840
<i>I messed up.</i>

00:59:38.670 --> 00:59:44.100
<i>I should have told him to forget about me</i>
<i>before turning into a cat.</i>

00:59:46.470 --> 00:59:48.430
<i>I want to go back to being a human.</i>

00:59:53.310 --> 00:59:54.150
Morning!

00:59:54.570 --> 00:59:55.400
Morning.

01:00:02.660 --> 01:00:03.780
Hinode!

01:00:05.330 --> 01:00:06.540
Morning!

01:00:06.620 --> 01:00:07.870
Morning...

01:00:09.870 --> 01:00:12.330
It's been three days since she returned,

01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:15.340
and she hasn't executed
a single Sunrise Attack.

01:00:15.420 --> 01:00:16.250
Yeah...

01:00:16.670 --> 01:00:18.840
Something's off about her...

01:00:19.300 --> 01:00:22.550
Is she still hurting over
that thing with the letter?

01:00:23.140 --> 01:00:24.470
You apologized to her, right?

01:00:25.220 --> 01:00:26.060
Yeah.

01:00:29.180 --> 01:00:32.600
Oh, my God, it's so cute!
Where did you come from?

01:00:33.020 --> 01:00:34.230
I've seen it around town.

01:00:34.770 --> 01:00:36.020
It's looking at us!

01:00:36.110 --> 01:00:37.860
-Look at those eyes.
-Come here, kitty!

01:00:43.070 --> 01:00:45.160
<i>I'm in trouble.</i>

01:00:46.080 --> 01:00:49.500
Add "ing" to a verb, and you get a gerund.

01:00:52.790 --> 01:00:56.250
What does the first example say? Sasaki?

01:00:57.170 --> 01:01:03.010
Let's see... "I hate dry rice."

01:01:03.090 --> 01:01:05.180
-What?
-I'm not too sure...

01:01:06.220 --> 01:01:07.680
<i>They're laughing at her joke.</i>

01:01:09.270 --> 01:01:13.520
<i>I have to do something.</i>
<i>That fake Muge is actually...</i>

01:01:15.190 --> 01:01:16.730
Hey, Mask Seller!

01:01:17.190 --> 01:01:20.280
Show yourself! Mask Seller!

01:01:23.200 --> 01:01:24.070
What?

01:01:35.040 --> 01:01:35.960
I'm home!

01:01:37.960 --> 01:01:42.130
Miyo? Yoji, Miyo's back!

01:01:42.420 --> 01:01:45.130
What? Miyo!

01:01:45.590 --> 01:01:49.510
You're back! Are you all right?
I was so worried!

01:01:49.600 --> 01:01:51.100
Did anyone try to hurt you?

01:01:52.140 --> 01:01:54.890
-You're soaked.
-I'm fine.

01:01:55.270 --> 01:01:57.230
You'll catch a cold.

01:01:57.310 --> 01:01:59.570
Here. I'll fill the bathtub.

01:02:01.360 --> 01:02:02.900
We'll eat once...

01:02:04.450 --> 01:02:06.280
Oh, my. I haven't...

01:02:12.200 --> 01:02:14.500
Thank. You.

01:02:25.220 --> 01:02:27.930
The feelings of others
are a mystery to us.

01:02:28.010 --> 01:02:29.600
The best we can do is guess.

01:02:29.720 --> 01:02:32.850
You shouldn't assume
you have someone figured out.

01:02:36.100 --> 01:02:37.060
See you.

01:02:37.440 --> 01:02:39.230
Okay, bye!

01:02:39.730 --> 01:02:42.860
What? Muge, wait up!

01:02:47.950 --> 01:02:51.950
I completely forgot we were
supposed to walk home together.

01:02:52.410 --> 01:02:53.740
Are you all right?

01:02:54.040 --> 01:02:55.290
Of course I am.

01:02:59.790 --> 01:03:03.880
Hey Hinode, I think I'll stay
at your house tonight.

01:03:03.960 --> 01:03:04.840
What?

01:03:05.300 --> 01:03:06.550
What are you talking about?

01:03:06.630 --> 01:03:10.680
I'll go to your house, eat your food,
and then we'll sleep together.

01:03:10.970 --> 01:03:11.930
-What?
-Wait, what?

01:03:12.310 --> 01:03:13.260
Are you nuts?

01:03:13.640 --> 01:03:15.140
Is this some kind of prank?

01:03:15.810 --> 01:03:17.520
-I can't do that?
-Of course not!

01:03:17.810 --> 01:03:19.230
What's wrong with you?

01:03:19.730 --> 01:03:21.560
I can't believe I was worried about you.

01:03:21.650 --> 01:03:22.690
Let's go, Isami.

01:03:23.400 --> 01:03:24.280
Muge...

01:03:24.360 --> 01:03:27.570
She really is
Miss Ultra Gaga and Enigmatic...

01:03:28.320 --> 01:03:30.990
I admire you for
being her friend for so long.

01:03:31.320 --> 01:03:33.240
-Thanks.
-Later!

01:03:33.740 --> 01:03:34.790
He rejected me.

01:03:35.160 --> 01:03:36.830
What did you expect?

01:03:37.040 --> 01:03:38.370
Oh, well.

01:03:43.040 --> 01:03:44.460
See you.

01:03:45.760 --> 01:03:46.590
Bye...

01:03:56.430 --> 01:03:57.600
Why, hello, little kitty.

01:03:57.980 --> 01:04:00.140
What? I can understand you!

01:04:00.690 --> 01:04:03.230
Well, I'm still half-cat,
not yet fully human.

01:04:03.770 --> 01:04:05.780
You're Kinako, right?

01:04:05.860 --> 01:04:06.820
Bingo.

01:04:07.150 --> 01:04:08.440
Kinako, listen...

01:04:08.530 --> 01:04:10.990
I want to go back to being a human.

01:04:11.820 --> 01:04:13.200
Give me back my face, please!

01:04:14.910 --> 01:04:16.790
I can't understand what Hinode says!

01:04:17.160 --> 01:04:19.660
That's because you're turning
into a real cat.

01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:23.210
Don't worry.
I'll make your dream come true.

01:04:23.460 --> 01:04:24.880
I'll go out with Hinode.

01:04:25.210 --> 01:04:27.840
Wait, are you sure you're okay with that?

01:04:27.920 --> 01:04:28.760
Hey, Kinako!

01:04:29.920 --> 01:04:33.090
I prefer being a cat, to be honest.

01:04:33.180 --> 01:04:34.510
Then why did you...

01:04:34.600 --> 01:04:36.140
I did it for her.

01:04:36.220 --> 01:04:40.020
Who? You mean Ms. Kaoru?

01:04:40.980 --> 01:04:43.150
She gave me happiness.

01:04:43.850 --> 01:04:46.360
<i>I want to return the favor.</i>

01:04:47.650 --> 01:04:50.610
<i>Humans can live a lot longer than cats.</i>

01:04:51.320 --> 01:04:53.320
<i>I'm almost at the end of my lifespan.</i>

01:04:55.490 --> 01:05:00.120
<i>I want Kaoru to be happy,</i>
<i>even when Kinako is gone.</i>

01:05:02.040 --> 01:05:06.500
You'll live your life as a cat.
I'll live your life.

01:05:07.170 --> 01:05:11.260
And I'll take your place
as Kaoru's daughter.

01:05:12.340 --> 01:05:15.090
No... No! No! No!

01:05:15.430 --> 01:05:16.720
I want to be with Hinode--

01:05:16.800 --> 01:05:18.760
It's too late for that.

01:05:19.600 --> 01:05:21.180
The Mask Seller and I

01:05:21.270 --> 01:05:25.020
will each get half of your lifespan.
That's how it works.

01:05:26.020 --> 01:05:29.820
No... How do I undo this?

01:05:30.190 --> 01:05:31.740
Where's the Mask Seller?

01:05:32.240 --> 01:05:34.030
He's usually on the other side.

01:05:34.740 --> 01:05:37.410
The other side? How do I get there?

01:05:38.160 --> 01:05:40.410
You should be able to see it
if you're a cat.

01:05:40.910 --> 01:05:42.580
What's that? A path?

01:05:43.250 --> 01:05:45.500
If you can see it,
your transformation's almost complete.

01:05:45.580 --> 01:05:46.710
Wait!

01:05:47.630 --> 01:05:49.750
I can't wait for the festival!

01:05:49.840 --> 01:05:51.010
Festival?

01:06:12.690 --> 01:06:14.400
HAVE YOU SEEN THIS CAT?
NAME: KINAKO, AGE: 12

01:06:14.490 --> 01:06:16.070
I'm sorry, Kaoru...

01:06:36.840 --> 01:06:37.720
What's this?

01:06:38.590 --> 01:06:41.560
It's a cute Torii gate. Is it for cats?

01:06:44.810 --> 01:06:47.270
I want to go back to being Miyo.

01:06:48.190 --> 01:06:50.110
No, no. No can do.

01:06:51.190 --> 01:06:52.070
Mask Seller!

01:06:52.400 --> 01:06:55.860
Why go back to your miserable human life?

01:06:55.950 --> 01:07:00.200
Lick your butt like a good cat
and have Hinode take care of you.

01:07:00.280 --> 01:07:04.540
Where's "the other side"?
And what's this "festival"? What--

01:07:05.960 --> 01:07:08.960
I heard about it from Kinako!
Kinako took my face!

01:07:09.290 --> 01:07:15.760
On the day of the next summer festival,
you'll become a real cat.

01:07:16.720 --> 01:07:17.760
The summer festival?

01:07:29.190 --> 01:07:30.190
What?

01:07:31.190 --> 01:07:34.860
Wait! I... I...

01:07:35.150 --> 01:07:36.740
I want to go back to being a human!

01:07:37.320 --> 01:07:41.570
I want to tell Hinode
how I feel about him.

01:07:46.830 --> 01:07:48.830
You should be able to see it
if you're a cat.

01:07:54.840 --> 01:07:57.300
What?! What's that?

01:08:09.520 --> 01:08:10.640
What...

01:08:11.150 --> 01:08:12.100
What?

01:08:12.190 --> 01:08:14.860
What on earth is that?

01:08:18.490 --> 01:08:19.650
I have to go there.

01:08:58.230 --> 01:08:59.440
INCOMING CALL
YORIKO FUKASE

01:08:59.530 --> 01:09:01.200
How do I use this again?

01:09:01.570 --> 01:09:03.200
-This one?
<i>-Hello?</i>

01:09:04.110 --> 01:09:05.120
Yes, hi!

01:09:05.200 --> 01:09:08.160
<i>-Are you used to using your phone yet?</i>
<i>-</i>No, not yet...

01:09:08.240 --> 01:09:12.750
<i>Which rock have you been living under?</i>
<i>Anyway, about the festival today...</i>

01:09:13.290 --> 01:09:14.250
The festival...

01:09:14.330 --> 01:09:16.250
<i>Isami called me.</i>

01:09:16.340 --> 01:09:19.210
<i>He's inviting both of us to join him</i>
<i>and Hinode at the festival.</i>

01:09:19.630 --> 01:09:21.260
Festival, huh?

01:09:21.340 --> 01:09:22.510
<i>What are you going to do?</i>

01:09:23.800 --> 01:09:25.970
I think I'll go with Ms. Kaoru.

01:09:26.180 --> 01:09:29.640
<i>What? Really? What about your mom?</i>

01:09:29.720 --> 01:09:31.180
She doesn't know my number yet.

01:09:31.730 --> 01:09:32.850
<i>I see...</i>

01:09:43.200 --> 01:09:45.030
Ms. Kaoru, are you all right?

01:09:47.120 --> 01:09:49.160
Miyo. Are you going out?

01:09:49.990 --> 01:09:51.120
No.

01:09:51.620 --> 01:09:53.750
Kinako still hasn't come home.

01:09:53.830 --> 01:09:56.460
She's never done this before.

01:09:57.880 --> 01:09:59.840
I don't mind if she forgets me.

01:09:59.920 --> 01:10:02.720
I just hope someone else
is taking care of her.

01:10:04.430 --> 01:10:06.220
I'll go look for her.

01:10:12.980 --> 01:10:13.810
Kaoru!

01:10:17.350 --> 01:10:18.690
"Ms." Kaoru...

01:10:19.400 --> 01:10:22.230
Kinako... Kinako...

01:10:22.570 --> 01:10:24.610
would never forget you.

01:10:26.280 --> 01:10:30.120
Kinako is happiest when she's with you.

01:10:31.160 --> 01:10:33.120
She loves you.

01:10:33.950 --> 01:10:37.330
I hope so. Thanks.

01:10:39.380 --> 01:10:40.710
Kaoru...

01:10:43.550 --> 01:10:44.470
I see.

01:10:44.550 --> 01:10:45.880
<i>You should come anyway.</i>

01:10:45.970 --> 01:10:48.720
-I'll be there. See you later.
<i>-Later.</i>

01:10:49.890 --> 01:10:51.560
Hey, Kento.

01:10:51.640 --> 01:10:55.890
Let's go to the festival together.
You should invite Mr. Sakaguchi too.

01:10:56.480 --> 01:10:58.060
I'm going with my friend.

01:10:58.310 --> 01:11:00.560
Well, how about you invite
Mr. Sakaguchi anyway?

01:11:00.650 --> 01:11:03.070
And then you can tell him
you can't make it.

01:11:03.150 --> 01:11:04.320
Do it yourself.

01:11:04.690 --> 01:11:09.280
Seriously? Oh, well, I'll get Grandpa...

01:11:10.030 --> 01:11:11.870
Muge isn't joining us?

01:11:16.080 --> 01:11:17.330
What are you doing?

01:11:17.660 --> 01:11:20.210
I need to ask you something.

01:11:20.290 --> 01:11:23.590
What is it?
Come in through the front door.

01:11:23.670 --> 01:11:25.710
How do you feel about me?

01:11:26.170 --> 01:11:28.840
-What? What do you mean?
-Do you like me?

01:11:28.930 --> 01:11:29.970
What?

01:11:30.720 --> 01:11:33.810
What are you talking about?
What's gotten into you lately?

01:11:34.470 --> 01:11:36.310
You'd never say that.

01:11:36.640 --> 01:11:39.140
I knew it. You saw through me.

01:11:39.230 --> 01:11:40.270
What?

01:11:40.690 --> 01:11:42.940
You know I'm not the real Muge.

01:11:44.940 --> 01:11:48.400
Would you stop teasing...

01:11:56.080 --> 01:11:57.370
What the--

01:12:00.580 --> 01:12:01.920
"What the--"

01:12:04.130 --> 01:12:07.670
Let me get this straight.
You don't want to be Muge anymore?

01:12:09.340 --> 01:12:10.970
I made a mistake.

01:12:11.050 --> 01:12:13.550
I can't replace Kinako as Muge.

01:12:14.100 --> 01:12:18.270
I underestimated
how much Kaoru loves Kinako.

01:12:20.310 --> 01:12:21.900
So Taro is Muge...

01:12:22.190 --> 01:12:24.440
That explains why
they both smell like the sun.

01:12:26.900 --> 01:12:27.780
I love you!

01:12:28.780 --> 01:12:30.700
I wish I'd known about this earlier.

01:12:31.150 --> 01:12:34.030
I feel sorry for her, though.

01:12:34.120 --> 01:12:37.410
Her mom is so irresponsible.
I don't blame her for wanting to be a cat.

01:12:38.870 --> 01:12:40.540
It must have been difficult for her.

01:12:40.830 --> 01:12:44.420
She can't imagine anyone ever loving her.

01:12:45.420 --> 01:12:46.750
Not even her own parents.

01:12:46.840 --> 01:12:50.380
So that's why you're the only one
who can save her.

01:12:50.800 --> 01:12:51.680
Please.

01:12:52.050 --> 01:12:54.050
Save her? Me?

01:12:54.930 --> 01:12:56.560
You can do it, Hinode.

01:12:56.850 --> 01:12:58.220
I feel like I'm being used.

01:13:02.560 --> 01:13:03.650
Cat Island?

01:13:03.730 --> 01:13:07.520
That's right.
The Sacred Tree will awaken today.

01:13:07.610 --> 01:13:10.110
Its power turns humans into cats
permanently.

01:13:10.740 --> 01:13:12.740
This is a lot to take in.

01:13:16.620 --> 01:13:18.700
-Give me your hand.
-Okay...

01:13:19.240 --> 01:13:21.080
Don't let go, okay?

01:13:26.130 --> 01:13:28.920
That's Cat Island
on the other side of this bridge.

01:13:29.130 --> 01:13:30.300
What bridge?

01:13:30.380 --> 01:13:32.800
Don't worry, I can see it.

01:13:32.880 --> 01:13:34.970
What? What do you mean?

01:13:36.680 --> 01:13:37.850
Something's there.

01:13:40.720 --> 01:13:42.560
You'll fall if you let go of my hand.

01:13:46.400 --> 01:13:48.770
You'd be able to see this bridge
if you were a cat.

01:13:48.860 --> 01:13:50.230
This is too much for me!

01:13:54.400 --> 01:13:56.320
What's taking Hinode so long?

01:13:56.620 --> 01:13:57.570
Yeah...

01:13:57.660 --> 01:13:59.530
The festival can't go on
in this rain anyway.

01:13:59.620 --> 01:14:00.450
Yeah...

01:14:00.540 --> 01:14:03.580
-Do you want to go to a cafe instead?
-Wait, is that...

01:14:07.710 --> 01:14:08.750
It's Yori.

01:14:09.500 --> 01:14:10.500
Hello?

01:14:10.920 --> 01:14:12.630
<i>Muge, where are you now?</i>

01:14:12.710 --> 01:14:14.930
On a bridge, I guess?

01:14:15.010 --> 01:14:18.220
<i>What? I saw Ms. Kaoru.</i>

01:14:19.810 --> 01:14:23.180
<i>She was looking for her cat in the rain.</i>
<i>She didn't even have an umbrella.</i>

01:14:24.230 --> 01:14:25.060
I see.

01:14:25.940 --> 01:14:26.850
<i>Are you alone?</i>

01:14:27.270 --> 01:14:29.110
No, Hinode is with me.

01:14:29.190 --> 01:14:30.270
What?

01:14:31.360 --> 01:14:33.570
Wait, who invited whom?

01:14:33.900 --> 01:14:35.740
<i>I invited him, I guess.</i>

01:14:37.240 --> 01:14:40.530
Say no more!
Go for it! I'm rooting for you!

01:14:41.080 --> 01:14:44.410
<i>You have to tell me</i>
<i>all about it tomorrow, okay?</i>

01:14:45.660 --> 01:14:48.460
Yeah. Muge is so lucky.

01:14:48.540 --> 01:14:50.460
<i>What are you talking about...</i>

01:14:51.290 --> 01:14:52.750
Hey, slow down!

01:15:17.650 --> 01:15:19.200
<i>What is this place?</i>

01:15:19.280 --> 01:15:22.330
<i>Everyone's a cat, and the sun never rises.</i>

01:15:22.580 --> 01:15:25.200
<i>No time to wonder. I have to find him!</i>

01:15:26.290 --> 01:15:29.250
Excuse me,
I'm looking for the Mask Seller.

01:15:29.330 --> 01:15:31.540
Mask Seller? What's that?

01:15:31.630 --> 01:15:34.920
-Is it delicious?
-You should eat something before you go.

01:15:35.510 --> 01:15:37.300
Yeah! You'll like our menu!

01:15:37.380 --> 01:15:39.680
Our rats are fresh, you know!

01:15:40.340 --> 01:15:41.390
No, thanks.

01:15:41.470 --> 01:15:43.720
Are you sure? It's really good.

01:15:51.940 --> 01:15:54.900
Somebody, anybody, please!
Where can I find the Mask Seller?

01:15:55.320 --> 01:15:57.030
Mask Seller!

01:15:57.360 --> 01:15:59.820
Mask Seller! Where are you?

01:16:00.490 --> 01:16:02.620
-Hey, Miss...
-Who, me?

01:16:03.160 --> 01:16:05.700
-You're half-human, aren't you?
-What?

01:16:05.990 --> 01:16:07.580
Your face was taken from you, huh?

01:16:08.120 --> 01:16:10.710
Do you know about the Mask Seller?

01:16:12.500 --> 01:16:13.880
Please tell me where he is!

01:16:14.750 --> 01:16:17.210
I have to see him.
I'll do whatever it takes!

01:16:21.430 --> 01:16:22.800
HUMAN-CAT BAR

01:16:23.510 --> 01:16:24.470
Come on in.

01:16:26.720 --> 01:16:28.850
We have a newcomer, you guys.

01:16:32.310 --> 01:16:33.190
I...

01:16:37.650 --> 01:16:41.200
So... this is Cat Island?

01:16:41.610 --> 01:16:45.370
And everyone in this bar used to be human?

01:16:45.450 --> 01:16:46.540
That's right.

01:16:46.990 --> 01:16:49.410
You want to be a cat too?

01:16:49.500 --> 01:16:52.870
You must have had an awful time
as a human being!

01:16:52.960 --> 01:16:55.460
Humans are horrible, aren't they?

01:16:55.750 --> 01:16:57.840
Well, that's a little extreme.

01:16:58.170 --> 01:16:59.920
-Hey, you.
-Yes?

01:17:00.550 --> 01:17:02.840
If you want to go back to being a human,

01:17:03.180 --> 01:17:04.890
you should leave as soon as possible.

01:17:05.390 --> 01:17:08.890
But I can't talk to humans as a cat.

01:17:09.270 --> 01:17:12.310
I need to tell someone how I really feel.

01:17:12.770 --> 01:17:14.730
-So...
-Why are you still here then?

01:17:15.730 --> 01:17:19.570
Once the Mask Seller takes your lifespan,
you'll be stuck here forever.

01:17:19.650 --> 01:17:21.740
You won't be able to go back
to being a human.

01:17:21.820 --> 01:17:24.240
That... would be a problem.

01:17:28.200 --> 01:17:30.250
-Is that a human?
-I haven't seen one in ages.

01:17:30.330 --> 01:17:32.330
-Brings back memories.
-Is he a cat-person?

01:17:34.040 --> 01:17:35.170
Watch your head.

01:17:36.250 --> 01:17:37.500
-Too late.
-Sorry.

01:17:39.590 --> 01:17:41.550
Excuse me!

01:17:44.220 --> 01:17:45.470
He isn't here.

01:17:54.810 --> 01:17:56.610
How about this one?

01:17:57.860 --> 01:17:59.480
All right, now do a somersault!

01:18:06.820 --> 01:18:08.830
What is this place?

01:18:09.330 --> 01:18:12.120
I can see my surroundings now.
That means I'm a cat--

01:18:14.660 --> 01:18:16.000
Only your hands? Why?

01:18:16.460 --> 01:18:17.290
How should I know?

01:18:22.050 --> 01:18:24.630
Welcome!

01:18:24.930 --> 01:18:28.600
You must be Hinode.

01:18:28.930 --> 01:18:30.970
-Mask Seller!
-"Mask Seller"?

01:18:31.430 --> 01:18:34.730
Hey, listen!
I want to return this face to Muge.

01:18:34.810 --> 01:18:36.730
-So--
-What was that?

01:18:37.980 --> 01:18:42.530
You mean you don't want
your share of her lifespan?

01:18:43.070 --> 01:18:47.950
In that case, I'll take your share too.
No complaints, right?

01:18:48.030 --> 01:18:49.030
No, wait!

01:18:57.670 --> 01:19:00.540
I have a question.
Don't you regret turning into a cat?

01:19:01.750 --> 01:19:04.260
I do, but what's the point
of dwelling on it?

01:19:04.340 --> 01:19:05.880
It just makes it more depressing.

01:19:06.170 --> 01:19:07.550
We ran away.

01:19:08.470 --> 01:19:10.550
All of us here chose to run
from our problems.

01:19:10.930 --> 01:19:11.930
That's right.

01:19:12.010 --> 01:19:12.970
Take me, for example.

01:19:13.560 --> 01:19:17.140
I ran from my responsibilities
as a mother.

01:19:19.100 --> 01:19:22.270
I was having doubts. Was I giving
my children the love they deserved?

01:19:22.940 --> 01:19:26.490
I began to feel like they knew
I wasn't up to the task.

01:19:27.450 --> 01:19:28.320
So I ran away.

01:19:29.320 --> 01:19:34.330
Me too.
I didn't know how to love or be loved.

01:19:34.700 --> 01:19:38.870
My insecurities suffocated me,
and I had to escape.

01:19:39.920 --> 01:19:41.710
We've come to terms with our decisions.

01:19:42.130 --> 01:19:44.050
But you still have your life ahead of you.

01:19:44.250 --> 01:19:46.420
Tell your special someone
how you really feel.

01:19:46.510 --> 01:19:47.760
I know you can do it!

01:19:48.380 --> 01:19:50.300
-Thanks!
-Too bad, so sad!

01:19:50.390 --> 01:19:51.220
What?

01:19:57.600 --> 01:20:00.230
Hinode isn't in the human realm.

01:20:00.560 --> 01:20:04.440
-What?
-I locked him in my shop.

01:20:04.860 --> 01:20:07.360
What? You did that to Hinode? Why?

01:20:07.740 --> 01:20:10.820
He came here to look for you.

01:20:11.160 --> 01:20:13.280
What? You're lying.

01:20:13.910 --> 01:20:17.160
Hinode doesn't even know I'm Taro.

01:20:17.250 --> 01:20:20.750
The cat that has your face...
Kinako, was it?

01:20:20.830 --> 01:20:23.420
She was with him,
so he probably heard from her.

01:20:23.500 --> 01:20:24.750
Kinako was with him?

01:20:24.840 --> 01:20:26.380
Yes, siree!

01:20:26.960 --> 01:20:29.550
Why couldn't they wait a little longer?

01:20:30.050 --> 01:20:32.260
You'll turn into a real cat soon enough.

01:20:34.800 --> 01:20:38.890
Hinode was looking for me? Why?

01:20:39.680 --> 01:20:41.480
We must not let them derail our plans.

01:20:41.810 --> 01:20:46.440
Let's hurry and get going
to the Promised Place now.

01:20:52.240 --> 01:20:53.160
Stop it.

01:20:54.530 --> 01:20:56.330
She's still a kid.

01:20:56.830 --> 01:21:00.410
Children have longer lifespans.
Much longer than you!

01:21:00.500 --> 01:21:02.040
I want her lifespan!

01:21:05.630 --> 01:21:07.380
We have to save this Hinode.

01:21:08.340 --> 01:21:09.880
Let's go to his shop.

01:21:10.260 --> 01:21:12.510
Yes. Thank you. All of you!

01:21:12.590 --> 01:21:14.340
-Hurry!
-Okay!

01:21:20.350 --> 01:21:23.100
Hinode is your special someone, right?

01:21:24.100 --> 01:21:26.820
-Yes.
-So he came for you.

01:21:27.980 --> 01:21:31.740
-I'm not so sure about that.
-He must be very brave to come here.

01:21:42.160 --> 01:21:43.120
It won't budge.

01:21:43.580 --> 01:21:44.420
We're here.

01:21:47.040 --> 01:21:48.460
Is someone there?

01:21:53.220 --> 01:21:55.140
Open the door, please!

01:21:55.220 --> 01:21:56.970
-Hinode.
-Please!

01:22:04.390 --> 01:22:05.560
Thank you very--

01:22:09.270 --> 01:22:13.190
Taro! No, wait. You're Muge, right?

01:22:14.150 --> 01:22:16.450
I can understand what you're saying!

01:22:18.990 --> 01:22:20.200
Your hands...

01:22:20.290 --> 01:22:24.000
I put on a mask,
but it didn't turn me into a cat.

01:22:24.500 --> 01:22:25.330
Just my hands...

01:22:26.790 --> 01:22:29.090
That's so like you, Hinode.

01:22:29.540 --> 01:22:30.590
What does that mean?

01:22:31.420 --> 01:22:32.920
You can have your face back.

01:22:33.340 --> 01:22:34.220
Kinako!

01:22:34.720 --> 01:22:36.430
Go back to being Miyo Sasaki.

01:22:39.800 --> 01:22:40.640
Finally!

01:22:50.610 --> 01:22:51.440
What?

01:22:51.690 --> 01:22:52.530
Why?

01:23:00.530 --> 01:23:01.450
Muge!

01:23:03.080 --> 01:23:04.000
Wait!

01:23:05.210 --> 01:23:07.830
This is bad.
The Sacred Tree is about to wake up.

01:23:09.630 --> 01:23:10.920
-Let's go!
-Okay!

01:23:11.750 --> 01:23:13.550
-Wait! You run so fast!
-Hurry!

01:23:15.720 --> 01:23:18.260
-Come on, hurry up!
-I'm running as fast as I can!

01:23:20.090 --> 01:23:21.180
Thanks.

01:23:22.310 --> 01:23:25.310
Why didn't she turn back into a human?

01:23:25.730 --> 01:23:29.150
Deep down, she believes turning back
will only bring her pain and suffering.

01:23:31.190 --> 01:23:33.020
It's up to you now.

01:23:38.280 --> 01:23:41.570
At this rate, Hinode will turn
into a cat too.

01:23:41.660 --> 01:23:45.500
Or maybe a half-cat? Whatever!

01:23:45.870 --> 01:23:47.370
I'm so happy!

01:23:51.580 --> 01:23:54.420
Hinode? Hinode!

01:23:59.880 --> 01:24:00.930
Muge!

01:24:01.430 --> 01:24:05.180
-Hinode! No! Not Hinode!
-Hey! Behave!

01:24:05.680 --> 01:24:07.310
Stop that!

01:24:07.930 --> 01:24:09.520
I have to go back to being a human!

01:24:11.850 --> 01:24:12.730
What?

01:24:18.240 --> 01:24:21.910
Hey! You have to
take better care of your life!

01:24:21.990 --> 01:24:25.330
It belongs to me now!

01:24:25.410 --> 01:24:27.830
Hey, hey! Come back here!

01:24:29.830 --> 01:24:31.330
What's going on?

01:24:35.040 --> 01:24:38.130
<i>Hinode shouldn't be here!</i>
<i>He has to go back!</i>

01:24:39.010 --> 01:24:43.090
<i>He said he wants to study pottery.</i>
<i>He wants to be like his grandpa!</i>

01:24:44.260 --> 01:24:45.180
Hinode! Over here!

01:24:49.180 --> 01:24:50.060
Muge!

01:24:51.810 --> 01:24:53.400
Muge!

01:24:54.310 --> 01:24:55.270
Hinode!

01:24:58.280 --> 01:25:01.490
Excuse me, is that going up?

01:25:01.860 --> 01:25:03.620
What? Oh, yes.

01:25:04.620 --> 01:25:05.740
Can I hitch a ride?

01:25:06.080 --> 01:25:07.160
Oh, sure thing!

01:25:09.160 --> 01:25:10.330
Is that going up?

01:25:10.410 --> 01:25:12.170
All clear!

01:25:12.580 --> 01:25:14.630
-Is that going up?
-Go!

01:25:19.130 --> 01:25:20.260
Hinode!

01:25:25.050 --> 01:25:27.560
Hinode! No!

01:25:28.100 --> 01:25:29.850
Go back!

01:25:35.060 --> 01:25:36.020
-Seriously?
-What?

01:25:36.110 --> 01:25:37.690
Muge!

01:25:40.070 --> 01:25:40.900
Hinode!

01:25:44.950 --> 01:25:45.780
Hinode!

01:25:52.250 --> 01:25:53.540
You can do it, Hinode!

01:26:04.510 --> 01:26:05.680
Let's go home, Muge.

01:26:06.300 --> 01:26:07.350
I...

01:26:10.180 --> 01:26:11.390
Hinode, I--

01:26:15.190 --> 01:26:16.020
I'm sorry.

01:26:16.440 --> 01:26:18.190
Why are you apologizing?

01:26:19.860 --> 01:26:22.940
I'm not the sharpest tool in the shed.

01:26:23.150 --> 01:26:25.450
I only realize who's been supporting me

01:26:25.740 --> 01:26:29.490
behind my back when they're gone.

01:26:30.120 --> 01:26:32.290
I've always been like this.

01:26:32.540 --> 01:26:33.410
I...

01:26:34.290 --> 01:26:38.210
I finally realized the truth
when I learned you were actually Taro.

01:26:39.840 --> 01:26:43.300
You cheer me up at school.
It was always you.

01:26:43.760 --> 01:26:46.970
Wait, really? Do you mean that, Hinode?

01:26:47.470 --> 01:26:50.760
And that's why I have to change! I--

01:26:53.180 --> 01:26:55.810
You should stay the way you are.

01:26:56.520 --> 01:26:57.440
Mask Seller!

01:26:58.190 --> 01:27:00.820
I'll take your lifespan too...

01:27:01.860 --> 01:27:04.570
-as compensation.
-Let go of him!

01:27:27.220 --> 01:27:30.300
Welcome to the Promised Place.

01:27:33.810 --> 01:27:36.520
There's no way out for you.

01:27:36.600 --> 01:27:40.020
The two of you will turn into a cat
and a half-cat soon enough.

01:27:40.100 --> 01:27:41.860
Your lifespans are mine!

01:27:43.520 --> 01:27:46.820
<i>Just a little more! Just a little more!</i>

01:27:49.030 --> 01:27:53.280
<i>Your lives are mine! I'm a happy cat!</i>

01:27:53.790 --> 01:27:57.040
<i>Cats are always happy forever and ever!</i>

01:28:22.770 --> 01:28:24.270
If we get out of here...

01:28:25.320 --> 01:28:26.980
and find the whole world gone...

01:28:28.030 --> 01:28:28.860
No...

01:28:29.700 --> 01:28:31.860
I don't care either way.

01:28:33.370 --> 01:28:35.370
I don't want you to disappear, Muge.

01:28:36.870 --> 01:28:37.870
Me too!

01:28:38.830 --> 01:28:41.830
I don't want you to disappear, Hinode.

01:28:49.260 --> 01:28:51.840
What?! That hurts!

01:28:51.930 --> 01:28:55.050
-Ow, ow, ow! No! You--
-Turn Muge back to normal!

01:28:55.140 --> 01:28:56.810
-How do we undo this?
-Hinode!

01:28:56.890 --> 01:29:00.230
-Tell me!
-She doesn't want to turn back!

01:29:00.310 --> 01:29:05.230
-I want to turn back!
-Your face doesn't want to go back!

01:29:05.940 --> 01:29:08.280
Even if you become human again,
nothing will change!

01:29:08.360 --> 01:29:09.610
That's not true!

01:29:09.940 --> 01:29:11.990
Once we turn back, we'll...

01:29:12.610 --> 01:29:14.200
We'll do better!

01:29:14.410 --> 01:29:16.700
Yeah! We'll do better!

01:29:25.290 --> 01:29:27.590
The Sacred Tree has awakened!

01:29:33.470 --> 01:29:36.640
-My body...
-What's happening...

01:29:41.930 --> 01:29:44.150
If you'll excuse me...

01:29:48.770 --> 01:29:52.610
-What?
-Very nice!

01:29:52.700 --> 01:29:54.860
-I'll take yours next and--
-Stop it!

01:29:57.030 --> 01:29:59.620
No! My lifespan!

01:29:59.700 --> 01:30:02.830
Wait! Hold on! Wait, wait!

01:30:03.790 --> 01:30:06.750
-Hey! Wait! Wait! Wait!
-I'm taking Muge with me!

01:30:08.710 --> 01:30:10.000
How can you do this to her?

01:30:10.090 --> 01:30:11.760
She didn't do anything wrong!

01:30:11.840 --> 01:30:15.220
-Come come!
-It isn't her fault she's in so much pain!

01:30:20.430 --> 01:30:21.310
No...

01:30:24.270 --> 01:30:25.600
<i>This is all my fault!</i>

01:30:27.100 --> 01:30:30.570
I have to do something,
or I'll regret this!

01:30:31.280 --> 01:30:33.070
I want to return his feelings!

01:30:40.200 --> 01:30:41.620
Not just Hinode!

01:30:42.950 --> 01:30:47.290
Ms. Kaoru, Dad, Mom...

01:30:48.250 --> 01:30:49.170
I...

01:30:50.420 --> 01:30:52.420
I never told them how I truly felt!

01:30:52.510 --> 01:30:54.340
-Give it up already!
-I...

01:30:54.670 --> 01:30:56.800
I hate this place!

01:30:57.220 --> 01:31:00.640
I want to go back! Let me go back!

01:31:08.150 --> 01:31:13.530
-We... have to go back!
-Hinode!

01:31:13.610 --> 01:31:17.280
Behave, or I'll tear you to pieces!

01:31:20.990 --> 01:31:21.910
What?

01:31:22.450 --> 01:31:24.540
I told you not to mess with them.

01:31:28.540 --> 01:31:29.670
You!

01:31:30.460 --> 01:31:31.290
Get him.

01:31:38.720 --> 01:31:42.300
No! Stop!

01:31:48.270 --> 01:31:49.270
Sorry we took so long.

01:31:49.730 --> 01:31:50.810
Thank you...

01:31:51.810 --> 01:31:54.280
They saved us.

01:32:30.640 --> 01:32:32.150
-Muge...
-Hinode!

01:32:33.690 --> 01:32:36.900
I want to know more about you.

01:32:38.240 --> 01:32:39.200
Hinode...

01:32:39.780 --> 01:32:41.990
Your Hinode Sunrise Attack, for example.

01:32:42.530 --> 01:32:45.410
<i>You do the craziest things.</i>

01:32:46.240 --> 01:32:48.080
But I want to see every side of you.

01:32:48.540 --> 01:32:51.460
Not just your smiling face.
I want to see your angry face.

01:32:51.540 --> 01:32:53.380
And your face when you act
like a spoiled child.

01:32:54.710 --> 01:32:58.880
Are you sure? How can you love me
if you see me at my worst?

01:32:59.340 --> 01:33:01.930
And I want to tell you, the human you...

01:33:02.340 --> 01:33:04.100
<i>that I love you.</i>

01:33:04.510 --> 01:33:07.720
<i>I want to see you smile again.</i>

01:33:09.230 --> 01:33:10.430
Me too.

01:33:11.060 --> 01:33:13.150
I want to see you laugh
like a child again.

01:33:14.810 --> 01:33:16.190
I want to tell you...

01:33:16.770 --> 01:33:18.690
that I love you.

01:33:18.980 --> 01:33:21.860
I don't want to wait to be loved.
I want to tell you how I feel.

01:33:22.860 --> 01:33:25.200
So, let's go back... together.

01:33:25.950 --> 01:33:27.280
Back to where we belong!

01:33:28.790 --> 01:33:33.170
You should go home too.
Treasure your owner.

01:33:33.920 --> 01:33:36.960
I will. All right, let's go!

01:33:37.040 --> 01:33:38.000
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

01:33:44.220 --> 01:33:46.010
Thank you for everything!

01:33:47.180 --> 01:33:48.600
Thanks for everything!

01:33:49.720 --> 01:33:51.430
Goodbye!

01:33:51.520 --> 01:33:52.520
Take care.

01:33:58.230 --> 01:34:01.240
Hinode, Kinako, thank you.

01:34:01.740 --> 01:34:04.070
I made you both worry so much.

01:34:04.490 --> 01:34:06.120
It's not just us.

01:34:06.870 --> 01:34:09.540
Fukase and Isami were worried
when they heard you ran away.

01:34:09.620 --> 01:34:13.000
Bannai and Niibori too.
They tried not to let it show, though.

01:34:14.460 --> 01:34:17.130
Your parents were worried sick.

01:34:17.500 --> 01:34:21.300
You may not know it,
but a lot of people care about you.

01:34:24.800 --> 01:34:28.600
I shut my heart to everyone.

01:34:29.180 --> 01:34:32.350
Ms. Kaoru, Dad, Mom...

01:34:33.480 --> 01:34:36.730
I told myself I didn't need them. They
were just scarecrows in the background.

01:34:42.740 --> 01:34:46.450
But now... I know I was wrong.

01:34:47.320 --> 01:34:49.700
I'll try to like them too.

01:35:21.860 --> 01:35:23.570
I'm human again!

01:35:25.860 --> 01:35:27.360
Me too!

01:35:32.990 --> 01:35:36.040
I hope everyone on the other side
can be happy too.

01:35:36.290 --> 01:35:37.120
Yeah.

01:36:05.990 --> 01:36:08.070
<i>Muge... I love you.</i>

01:36:08.950 --> 01:36:12.030
<i>Me too. I love you so much, Hinode!</i>

01:36:16.200 --> 01:36:17.910
I'm home.

01:36:19.500 --> 01:36:21.210
Welcome--

01:36:21.670 --> 01:36:22.750
Kinako!

01:36:23.500 --> 01:36:25.340
I'm so glad you're back!

01:36:29.880 --> 01:36:33.430
Kinako likes me now.

01:36:34.430 --> 01:36:36.270
Oh, come on...

01:36:43.020 --> 01:36:44.360
I...

01:36:44.900 --> 01:36:46.530
I want to be a potter.

01:36:52.280 --> 01:36:55.160
I guess the kiln won't be
going into the shed.

01:36:58.040 --> 01:36:59.080
Thanks.

01:37:01.580 --> 01:37:03.210
Whatever...

01:37:04.630 --> 01:37:06.130
I love you...

01:37:06.670 --> 01:37:08.210
Oh, but I...

01:37:08.920 --> 01:37:11.220
I'm engaged...

01:37:12.890 --> 01:37:14.430
Sorry...

01:37:16.140 --> 01:37:18.770
Oh, man...

01:37:20.680 --> 01:37:23.150
Hold it!

01:37:26.070 --> 01:37:28.530
You held hands?

01:37:32.820 --> 01:37:35.780
You told him you love him!?

01:37:40.790 --> 01:37:43.750
He loves you too!?

01:37:44.540 --> 01:37:46.540
I'm so happy for you!

01:37:48.000 --> 01:37:49.550
Thanks.

01:38:04.940 --> 01:38:07.190
See you!

01:38:07.900 --> 01:38:09.320
See you...

01:38:21.200 --> 01:38:22.370
Morning!

01:38:24.040 --> 01:38:25.210
-Morning...
-Morning...

01:38:25.870 --> 01:38:27.210
Have a good day!

01:38:29.420 --> 01:38:30.380
Hey...

01:38:31.880 --> 01:38:32.800
Hey...

01:38:34.590 --> 01:38:35.550
What is it?

01:38:35.630 --> 01:38:36.800
Oh, nothing.

01:38:36.890 --> 01:38:38.430
Stop staring!

01:38:38.510 --> 01:38:40.260
Don't mind me.

01:38:42.930 --> 01:38:45.270
There's nothing between us, okay?

01:38:45.560 --> 01:38:46.400
If you say so.

01:38:46.480 --> 01:38:48.020
No, really!

01:38:48.110 --> 01:38:49.360
If you say so.

01:38:57.110 --> 01:38:59.580
Hinode Sunrise...

01:39:00.240 --> 01:39:01.580
Attack!

01:43:41.610 --> 01:43:44.320
THE END

01:43:44.400 --> 01:43:46.110
<i>Hinode Sunrise is when</i>

01:43:46.490 --> 01:43:50.570
<i>the sun rises above the horizon</i>
<i>and warms my soul.</i>
